      "text": "RT @stark0xbt: Gavin Baker owned 15% of Nvidia and 10% of Tesla sub-$2 billion. His biggest regret won't be either. It'll be the price you'…",
      "created_at": "Thu Sep 24 22:22:52 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
